@startuml
actor User
participant CoolManager
participant Refrigerator
participant SetPoint
participant NormalState

User -> CoolManager: Solicitar mover SetPoint hacia abajo
activate CoolManager
CoolManager -> CoolManager: moveSetPointDown()
CoolManager -> Refrigerator: currentState.execute() (NormalState)
Refrigerator -> SetPoint: PushSetPointDownAction
SetPoint -> SetPoint: Decrementar valor del SetPoint
deactivate CoolManager
@enduml